5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to verify if the proposed schedules can survive external disruptions before committing.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I’m worried about how the new service will reach people in the outer wards, especially with current transport gaps.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I want to see how the funding is structured, not just the total amount.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m curious why we keep debating new ideas without checking if similar ones already failed here.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m just wondering if we actually have the right people on staff to handle whatever we choose.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Ryuji, I agree. We must check if our timelines depend on factors outside our control, like supplier delays or weather.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Yumi, exactly. The location and opening hours decide who can actually reach us, so we must check the transport gaps first.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@George, precisely. I need to see how the money is structured, not just the headline figure, to ensure it lasts beyond the first year.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@May, I agree. We need to review the records of past initiatives to see if we are repeating mistakes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Daisuke, I agree. We need to confirm the staff actually have the skills before adding more work.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, the grant terms might reveal if our funding is just a temporary patch.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@George, the grant terms might reveal if our funding is just a temporary patch.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, @Yumi, you’re right. I’ll look into the county grant terms and the endowment to see how the money is actually shaped.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@May, I’ll check the two programmes begun six years ago to see what records they left behind.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Daisuke, I’ll check the volunteer register and supervision training to see if we have the skills needed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Ryuji, I’ll check the quoted delivery windows from suppliers and the winter road closures north of the river.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Yumi, I’ll check the bus links in the two outer wards and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,"@George, I’ll check the running and equipment lines last year to see where the money actually went.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"@May, I’ll check the two programmes begun six years ago and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Daisuke, I’ll check the volunteer register and supervision training to see if we have the skills needed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
